          }
        }
      }
    },
    "喵空间只看你选进来的照片，在这台 iPhone 上从里面找出家具和拍摄日期。照片只有你自己看得到。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Meowverse looks only at the photos you pick, and finds the furniture and the dates in them on this iPhone. Only you can see them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "喵空间只读取你亲手选进来的照片，不会翻看其他照片。你打开了 iCloud 同步和“备份到 iCloud 云盘”，喵空间存的照片（较小的照片和在 App 里拍的照片就是原文件）会通过 Apple 的 iCloud 同步到你自己的设备，也会随备份存进你自己的 iCloud 云盘。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Meowverse reads only the photos you pick yourself and never looks at other photos. You turned on iCloud Sync and Back Up to iCloud Drive, so the photos Meowverse keeps (for smaller photos and ones taken in the app, the original files) sync to your own devices through Apple’s iCloud and also go into your own iCloud Drive with each backup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "喵空间只读取你亲手选进来的照片，不会翻看其他照片。你打开了 iCloud 同步，喵空间存的照片（较小的照片和在 App 里拍的照片就是原文件）会通过 Apple 的 iCloud 同步到你自己的设备。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Meowverse reads only the photos you pick yourself and never looks at other photos. You turned on iCloud Sync, so the photos Meowverse keeps (for smaller photos and ones taken in the app, the original files) sync to your own devices through Apple’s iCloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "喵空间只读取你亲手选进来的照片，不会翻看其他照片。你打开了“备份到 iCloud 云盘”，喵空间存的照片（较小的照片和在 App 里拍的照片就是原文件）会随备份存进你自己的 iCloud 云盘。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
