            "value" : "Meowverse reads only the photos you pick yourself and never looks at other photos. With Back Up to iCloud Drive on, the photos Meowverse keeps (for smaller photos and ones taken in the app, the original files) go into your own iCloud Drive with each backup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "喵空间只读取你亲手选进来的照片，不会翻看其他照片。现在不会上传任何照片，但之前同步的家还在你自己的 iCloud 里，里面有喵空间存的照片副本。" : {
