    "iCloud 云盘里有喵空间的备份" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There’s a Meowverse backup in iCloud Drive"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 云盘里的喵空间备份不会跟着删除，还能用来恢复。不需要的话，可以在“文件”App 的 iCloud 云盘 › Meowverse 里删除。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Meowverse backups in iCloud Drive are not deleted with it and can still restore everything. If you don’t need them, delete them in the Files app under iCloud Drive › Meowverse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 云盘里的喵空间备份不会跟着删除，还能用来恢复。备份到 iCloud 云盘仍然开着：房间里再有内容时会备份新的一份，并删掉这台设备存的旧备份。要现在删除，请到“备份到 iCloud 云盘”里停止备份并删除，或在“文件”App 的 iCloud 云盘 › Meowverse 里删除。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Meowverse backups in iCloud Drive are not deleted with it and can still restore everything. Back Up to iCloud Drive stays on: once the room has something in it again, a new backup is made and this device’s older one is removed. To delete them now, stop backing up under Back Up to iCloud Drive and delete them there, or delete them in the Files app under iCloud Drive › Meowverse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 云盘里还没有喵空间的备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There are no Meowverse backups in iCloud Drive yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 储存空间已满，这份备份还没有上传，只在这台设备上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud storage is full. This backup hasn’t uploaded and exists only on this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 储存空间已满，这次没有备份。之前的备份没有受影响。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud storage is full, so no backup was made. Earlier backups are untouched."
