    },
    "iCloud 同步" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Sync"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 同步已关闭。这台设备上的家和 iCloud 里的数据都还在。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Sync is off. The home on this device and the data in iCloud are both still there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 同步开着。只清除这台设备上的家：iCloud 里的家和其他设备都不动，这台设备的 iCloud 同步会关闭，否则 iCloud 里的家会同步回来。也删除 iCloud 里的家：所有打开了同步的设备上的家都会被清空。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Sync is on. Erase on this device only: the home in iCloud and your other devices stay as they are, and iCloud Sync is turned off on this device, or the home in iCloud would sync back. Also delete the home in iCloud: the home is emptied on every device that syncs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 同步开着，它会和 iCloud 里的家合并。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Sync is on, so it will be merged with the home in iCloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 现在很忙，稍后会自动再试。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud is busy right now. Meowverse will try again shortly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 里喵空间的同步数据已被删除，可能是在系统“设置”里删的。这台设备上的家没有动，同步已暂停。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Meowverse’s sync data in iCloud was deleted, perhaps in the Settings app. The home on this device is untouched, and syncing is paused."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 里的原图要先下载，需要网络，可能要等一会儿。可以先做别的，导入会接着进行。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Full-size photos in iCloud are downloaded first. This needs a connection and can take a while. You can do other things; the import carries on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud 里的原图要先下载，需要网络，可能要等一会儿。可以先做别的，导入会接着进行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 里的原图要先下载，需要网络，可能要等一会儿。可以先点「完成」去做别的，照片会接着添加。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Full-size photos in iCloud are downloaded first. This needs a connection and can take a while. You can tap Done and do other things; the photos keep being added."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
