          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 里的家也要删除吗？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete the Home in iCloud Too?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 里的家会被删除。所有登录同一个 Apple 账户、打开了 iCloud 同步的 iPhone 和 iPad 上，照片、家具、房间和猫咪也会一起被清空。无法撤销。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The home in iCloud will be deleted. On every iPhone and iPad signed in to the same Apple Account with iCloud Sync on, the photos, furniture, rooms and cats are erased too. This cannot be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已清除这台设备上的全部数据，也删除了 iCloud 里的家，但 iCloud 里有些记录这台设备读不懂或还没取到，原样留着，没有删除。其他设备同步后也会清空，这些记录里的内容除外。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All data on this device is erased and the home in iCloud is deleted, except some records this device can’t read or hasn’t fetched yet: they stay in iCloud as they are. Other devices are emptied when they sync, apart from what those records hold."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 里的家只删除了一部分，剩下的会在下次同步时接着删除，到时这台设备上的家也会跟着清空。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only part of the home in iCloud was deleted. The rest is deleted with the next sync, and the home on this device is emptied then too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 里的家已删除，但这台设备上的数据没能清除。下次同步时会跟着清空，也可以再试一次。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The home in iCloud was deleted, but the data on this device couldn’t be erased. It is emptied with the next sync, or you can try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
