      }
    },
    "「%@」里的 %lld 件家具会连同照片收进收纳箱，可以再摆进别的房间。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%#@n2@"
          },
          "substitutions" : {
            "n2" : {
              "argNum" : 2,
              "formatSpecifier" : "lld",
              "variations" : {
                "plural" : {
                  "one" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "The %arg piece in “%1$@” goes to the storage box with its photos. You can place it in another room later."
                    }
                  },
                  "other" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "The %arg pieces in “%1$@” go to the storage box with their photos. You can place them in another room later."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%1$@」里的 %2$lld 件家具会连同照片收进收纳箱，可以再摆进别的房间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“照片”没能保存这张照片，可能是储存空间不够。它也还没有存进喵空间。放进家具或选“只存照片，不添家具”后才会保存。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Photos couldn’t save this photo, possibly because storage is low. It isn’t saved in Meowverse yet either. It’s saved once you put it in furniture or choose “Save the photo only, no furniture”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 储存空间已满，这台设备上有改动或照片还没能上传。空间够了会接着同步。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud storage is full, so some changes or photos on this device haven’t uploaded. Syncing continues when there’s room."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 同步开着：确认后，这台设备先换成这份备份，再和 iCloud 里的家合并。备份之后删掉的内容会回到所有同步的设备上；备份之后改过并已同步的内容大多保持现在的样子。这台设备上还没同步的改动会被替换，无法撤销。要让这台设备整份回到备份那时，请先取消并关闭同步。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud sync is on. When you confirm, this device switches to this backup and then merges with the home in iCloud. Things deleted since the backup come back on every synced device, and most changes synced since then stay as they are now. Changes on this device that haven’t synced yet are replaced and can’t be undone. To take this device all the way back to the backup, cancel and turn off sync first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一份备份约 %@。iCloud 里只保留这台设备最新的一份；新的一份核对无误后，才会删掉上一份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A backup is about %@. iCloud keeps only the newest one from this device; the previous one is removed only after the new one has been checked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
