    "恢复并合并" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Restore and merge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "房间不会变化。上次拍的这张照片没有存进“照片”，不添加就不会留下。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The room won’t change. The photo you took last time isn’t in Photos, so it won’t be kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按建议放进家具，这次没能完成比对。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "File as suggested, couldn’t finish comparing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 %lld 张在更新版本的家具上，这台设备暂时显示不了那些家具。删除后，它们也不再包含这些照片。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%#@n1@"
          },
          "substitutions" : {
            "n1" : {
              "argNum" : 1,
              "formatSpecifier" : "lld",
              "variations" : {
                "plural" : {
                  "one" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "%arg photo is on furniture from a newer version, which this device can’t show yet. Deleting takes it off that furniture too."
                    }
                  },
                  "other" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "%arg photos are on furniture from a newer version, which this device can’t show yet. Deleting takes them off that furniture too."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有 %lld 张在更新版本的家具上，这台设备暂时显示不了那些家具。删除后，它们也不再包含这些照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 %lld 张照片的文件在这台设备上没法使用，所以没有显示。可能是文件损坏了，或者这台设备的系统读不了这种格式。下次打开 App 时会再试一次。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%#@n1@"
          },
          "substitutions" : {
            "n1" : {
              "argNum" : 1,
              "formatSpecifier" : "lld",
              "variations" : {
                "plural" : {
                  "one" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "%arg photo’s file can’t be used on this device, so it isn’t shown. It may be damaged, or in a format this system can’t read. Meowverse tries again next time it opens."
                    }
                  },
                  "other" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "%arg photos have files that can’t be used on this device, so they aren’t shown. They may be damaged, or in a format this system can’t read. Meowverse tries again next time it opens."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有 %lld 张照片的文件在这台设备上没法使用，所以没有显示。可能是文件损坏了，或者这台设备的系统读不了这种格式。下次打开 App 时会再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有存进系统相册的照片，喵空间里的可能是唯一一份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For photos not saved to the Photos app, Meowverse may hold the only copy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除喵空间里的全部照片、家具、便签和猫咪的名字。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deletes all photos, furniture, notes and your cat’s name from Meowverse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份到 iCloud 云盘开着：下一次备份里也不会再有删掉的照片。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Back Up to iCloud Drive is on, so the next backup will no longer have what you delete."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 同步开着：打开了同步的其他设备上也会删除。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Sync is on, so the deletion also happens on your other devices with sync on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "其中 %lld 张没能确认系统相册里还有原片，可能是唯一一份。" : {
      "comment" : "no-plural: 'of these' reads the same for one and for many",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn’t confirm an original in the Photos app for %lld of these, so Meowverse may hold the only copy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没能处理刚拍的照片，它没有存下来。请再拍一张。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn’t process the photo you just took, so it wasn’t saved. Please take another."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没能打开上次拍的照片。它还暂存在这台设备上，下次打开喵空间时会再问你。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
