      }
    },
    "只有导出过的备份能恢复这些内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only a backup you exported can bring this content back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有导出过的备份能恢复这些内容。备份到 iCloud 云盘仍然开着，房间里再有内容时会再备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only a backup you exported can bring this content back. Back Up to iCloud Drive stays on and backs up again once the room has something in it."
