    "只清除这台设备上的家" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erase on This Device Only"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只用照片上已知的拍摄日期，日期未知的照片不会出现在“历史上的今天”。回忆在晚上 8 点左右送达，点开会打开那件家具。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only known capture dates are used; photos with an unknown date never appear in On This Day. Memories arrive around 8 pm, and tapping one opens that piece of furniture."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只用照片上已知的拍摄日期，日期未知的照片不会出现在“历史上的今天”。回忆在晚上 8 点左右送达，点开会打开那件家具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只看选中家具里的照片。可以选几件。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Show only photos on the chosen furniture. You can choose several pieces."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只看锁定的" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Locked Only"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只读取你在相册里选中的照片。第一次添加照片时会问一次相册权限：允许后每张照片只存小预览，看大图时从相册读取，而且只读你导入过的那些照片；不允许也能照常使用，之后可以在设置里更改。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Meowverse reads only the photos you pick. The first time you add a photo, it asks once for access to your photos: with access it keeps only a small preview and reads the full-size photo from your library, and only for photos you have imported. Everything works without it, and you can change this in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以去看那件家具，也可以用它再添一件。照片只保存一份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can view that piece, or use this photo to add another one. The photo is stored only once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
