    "在喵空间里拍的照片会另存一份到系统相册，删除 App 后仍然保留。没有存进相册的照片，喵空间会保存完整原图，占用的空间更多。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Photos you take in Meowverse are also saved to your photo library, so they stay even if you delete the app. A photo that isn’t in your library is kept by Meowverse at full size, which takes more space."
