    "备份到现在登录的账户" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Back Up to This Account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份存在你自己的 iCloud 云盘里（“文件”App › iCloud 云盘 › Meowverse），由系统上传。你还打开了 iCloud 同步，喵空间会通过 Apple 的 iCloud 和你自己的设备同步，开发者拿不到这些数据。房间有改动时，打开或离开 App 时会自动备份，最多每天一次。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Backups are kept in your own iCloud Drive (Files › iCloud Drive › Meowverse) and uploaded by the system. You also turned on iCloud Sync: Meowverse syncs with your own devices through Apple’s iCloud, and the developer has no access to this data. When your room has changed, it backs up automatically as you open or leave the app, at most once a day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份存在你自己的 iCloud 云盘里（“文件”App › iCloud 云盘 › Meowverse），由系统上传。备份这一步喵空间自己不联网。房间有改动时，打开或离开 App 时会自动备份，最多每天一次。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Backups are kept in your own iCloud Drive (Files › iCloud Drive › Meowverse) and uploaded by the system. Meowverse itself doesn’t go online to back up. When your room has changed, it backs up automatically as you open or leave the app, at most once a day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份完成并通过核对，已放进 iCloud 云盘，由系统上传。" : {
