            "value" : "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果喵空间能读取相册，每张照片在喵空间里只存一张小预览，设备空间和 iCloud 空间都占得更少；看大图时直接从你的相册读取。这要用到对所有照片的访问。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If Meowverse can read your Photos library, it keeps only a small preview of each photo, so it uses less space on your device and in iCloud, and reads the full-size photo straight from your library when you open it. This needs access to all photos."
