      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Storage space"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "存到你自己的 iCloud 云盘：“文件”App › iCloud 云盘 › Meowverse。上传由系统完成。你打开的 iCloud 同步另由喵空间通过 Apple 的 iCloud 和你自己的设备同步，开发者拿不到这些数据。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saved to your own iCloud Drive: Files › iCloud Drive › Meowverse. The system does the upload. The iCloud Sync you turned on is separate: Meowverse syncs with your own devices through Apple’s iCloud, and the developer has no access to this data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "存到你自己的 iCloud 云盘：“文件”App › iCloud 云盘 › Meowverse。上传由系统完成，这一步喵空间自己不联网。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saved to your own iCloud Drive: Files › iCloud Drive › Meowverse. The system does the upload; Meowverse itself doesn’t go online for it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "存在你自己的 iCloud 私有数据库里，占用你的 iCloud 储存空间。喵空间的开发者看不到这些内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kept in your own private iCloud database, using your iCloud storage. Meowverse’s developer cannot see any of it."
