    "想要什么？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What would you like?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "想要新的家具、新的玩法，或者希望哪里更顺手？写下来会变成一封发给开发者的邮件，用“邮件”App 发出。发送前你能看到并修改全部内容，喵空间自己不会发送任何东西。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Want a new piece of furniture, a new way to play, or something to work more smoothly? Your note becomes an email to the developer, sent with the Mail app. You can read and edit everything before sending; Meowverse sends nothing itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
