    "这台设备的储存空间不够，没能保存。腾出一些空间后再试。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This device is out of storage, so it couldn’t save. Free up some space, then try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这张照片没能暂存在这台设备上，现在退出喵空间它就会丢失。放进家具或选“只存照片，不添家具”就会保存。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This photo couldn’t be held on this device, so it will be lost if you quit Meowverse now. It’s saved once you put it in furniture or choose “Save the photo only, no furniture”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这张刚拍的照片还没有存进喵空间，也不会存进“照片”。放进家具或选“只存照片，不添家具”后才会保存。" : {
      "localizations" : {
