    "打开 iCloud 同步" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn On iCloud Sync"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开 iCloud 同步后，你的家和喵空间保存的照片副本会通过 Apple 的 CloudKit 存进你自己的 iCloud，在登录同一个 Apple 账户的设备之间同步。开发者看不到这些内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With iCloud Sync on, your home and the photo copies Meowverse keeps are stored in your own iCloud through Apple’s CloudKit and synced between devices signed in to the same Apple Account. The developer cannot see any of it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开 iCloud 同步？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
