    },
    "打开后不会马上上传；下次离开 App 时，或你点“立即备份”时，才会生成第一份备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nothing is uploaded right away. The first backup is made the next time you leave the app or tap “Back Up Now”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开后，新导入的照片在喵空间里只存一张小预览，更省空间；看大图时从相册读取。需要允许访问所有照片，喵空间只会读取你导入过的那些。相册里的照片删掉后，这里仍留着小预览。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When this is on, Meowverse keeps only a small preview of each newly imported photo, which saves space, and reads the full-size photo from your Photos library when you open it. This needs access to all photos; Meowverse reads only the ones you have imported. If a photo is deleted from Photos, the small preview stays here."
          }
