    },
    "照片保存在这台设备上。你打开了 iCloud 同步和“备份到 iCloud 云盘”：喵空间存的照片副本会通过 Apple 的 iCloud 同步到你自己的其他设备，备份存在你自己的 iCloud 云盘，开发者都拿不到。如果你用了设备备份（iCloud 或电脑），系统会把它们一起备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your photos are stored on this device. You turned on iCloud Sync and Back Up to iCloud Drive: the copies Meowverse keeps sync to your own other devices through Apple’s iCloud, and backups are kept in your own iCloud Drive; the developer has access to neither. If you use a device backup (iCloud or computer), it includes them along with everything else."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照片保存在这台设备上。你打开了 iCloud 同步，喵空间存的照片副本还会通过 Apple 的 iCloud 同步到你自己的其他设备，开发者拿不到。如果你用了设备备份（iCloud 或电脑），系统会把它们一起备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your photos are stored on this device. You turned on iCloud Sync, so the copies Meowverse keeps also sync to your own other devices through Apple’s iCloud; the developer has no access to them. If you use a device backup (iCloud or computer), it includes them along with everything else."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照片保存在这台设备上。你打开了“备份到 iCloud 云盘”，备份里的照片副本存在你自己的 iCloud 云盘，由系统上传，开发者拿不到。喵空间没有自己的服务器。如果你用了设备备份（iCloud 或电脑），系统会把它们一起备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your photos are stored on this device. You turned on Back Up to iCloud Drive, so the photo copies in each backup are kept in your own iCloud Drive and uploaded by the system; the developer has no access to them. Meowverse has no server of its own. If you use a device backup (iCloud or computer), it includes them along with everything else."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照片保存在这台设备上，喵空间不会再上传。之前同步的家还在你自己的 iCloud 里，包括照片副本。开发者拿不到它们，喵空间没有自己的服务器。如果你用了设备备份（iCloud 或电脑），系统会把它们一起备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your photos are stored on this device, and Meowverse uploads nothing now. The home synced earlier, with copies of the photos, is still in your own iCloud. The developer has no access to them; Meowverse has no server of its own. If you use a device backup (iCloud or computer), it includes them along with everything else."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照片保存在这台设备上，喵空间不会再上传。之前存进你自己 iCloud 云盘的备份还在，里面有照片副本，可以在“文件”App 的 iCloud 云盘 › Meowverse 里删除。开发者拿不到它们，喵空间没有自己的服务器。如果你用了设备备份（iCloud 或电脑），系统会把它们一起备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your photos are stored on this device, and Meowverse uploads nothing now. The backups made earlier, with copies of the photos, are still in your own iCloud Drive; you can delete them in Files › iCloud Drive › Meowverse. The developer has no access to them; Meowverse has no server of its own. If you use a device backup (iCloud or computer), it includes them along with everything else."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照片保存在这台设备上，喵空间不会再上传。之前的备份和同步的家还在你自己的 iCloud 里，包括照片副本，备份可以在“文件”App 的 iCloud 云盘 › Meowverse 里删除。开发者拿不到它们，喵空间没有自己的服务器。如果你用了设备备份（iCloud 或电脑），系统会把它们一起备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your photos are stored on this device, and Meowverse uploads nothing now. The backups and the home synced earlier, with copies of the photos, are still in your own iCloud; you can delete the backups in Files › iCloud Drive › Meowverse. The developer has no access to them; Meowverse has no server of its own. If you use a device backup (iCloud or computer), it includes them along with everything else."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照片保存在这台设备上，喵空间不会把它们传到任何服务器。如果你用了设备备份（iCloud 或电脑），系统会把它们一起备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your photos are stored on this device. Meowverse does not send them to any server. If you use a device backup (iCloud or computer), it includes them along with everything else."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照片信息里记录的是 %@。保存后会显示你选的日期，原来的记录仍然保留。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
