    },
    "现在就生成一份新的备份。房间没有改动时不会重复备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Makes a new backup now. Nothing is repeated if the room hasn’t changed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "现在没能确认 iCloud 云盘里有没有喵空间的备份。如果有，它们不会跟着删除。备份到 iCloud 云盘仍然开着：房间里再有内容时会备份新的一份，并删掉这台设备存的旧备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whether iCloud Drive holds Meowverse backups couldn’t be checked right now. Any that are there are not deleted with it. Back Up to iCloud Drive stays on: once the room has something in it again, a new backup is made and this device’s older one is removed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "现在没能确认 iCloud 云盘里有没有喵空间的备份。如果有，它们不会跟着删除，可以在“文件”App 的 iCloud 云盘 › Meowverse 里查看。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whether iCloud Drive holds Meowverse backups couldn’t be checked right now. Any that are there are not deleted with it; you can find them in the Files app under iCloud Drive › Meowverse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "现在没有网络。改动都留在这台设备上，联网后会自动同步。" : {
      "localizations" : {
