      }
    },
    "诊断信息只有：App 和 iOS 的版本、设备型号、语言与地区、文字大小、“减弱动态效果”和“旁白”是否打开、照片和家具的数量、资料库的版本号、剩余空间的大致范围、这台设备比对一张照片大约要多久，以及喵空间本次运行的最近记录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diagnostics contain only: the app and iOS versions, the device model, language and region, text size, whether Reduce Motion and VoiceOver are on, how many photos and pieces of furniture you have, the library version, a rough range of free space, about how long this device takes to compare one photo, and Meowverse’s recent log from this session."
